      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kimmswick%2C_Missouri",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "During the festival, the streets are lined with 500–600 food, drink, and craft vendors and live bluegrass, country rock, and dulcimer music.",
